{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:7af6e37093a959d7","name":"Massassi Lanvarok","source":{"id":"source:reference-7af6e37093a959d7","title":"Massassi Lanvarok","revision":19247,"timestamp":"2024-08-25T21:35:38Z","sha256":"9a8571b28fdac9a9023e107f3b2fbe9a8993ccf91e421bfe76ee49b1a41e8057","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=19247","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Massassi%20Lanvarok&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-7af6e37093a959d7","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Knights of the Old Republic Campaign Guide"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Knights_of_the_Old_Republic_Campaign_Guide"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["The Lanvarok is an ancient weapon that comes in two varieties: the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Sith Lanvarok"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Sith_Lanvarok","referenceId":"reference:dfa9937bd51de719"},", and the Massassi Lanvarok. A Massassi Lanvarok is a large, polearmlike weapon that can be used to hurl small discs at opponents.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["A disc flung from a Massassi Lanvarok is treated as a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Thrown Weapon"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Thrown_Weapon"}," for the purpose of determining ",{"tag":"a","children":["Range"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Range"},". After the disc is hurled, the weapon can be used as a normal two-handed Slashing weapon (dealing 1d8 damage on a successful hit). ",{"tag":"a","children":["Massassi"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Massassi","referenceId":"reference:5369acf6589c1958"}," and ",{"tag":"a","children":["Kissai"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Kissai","referenceId":"reference:f6cd5be372e0cf33"}," treat the Massassi Lanvarok as a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Simple Weapon (Ranged)"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Simple_Weapon_(Ranged)"}," instead of as an ",{"tag":"a","children":["Exotic Weapon (Ranged)"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Exotic_Weapon_(Ranged)"},". A Massassi Lanvarok requires disc ammunition, and only holds one disc at a time. Each disc weighs 0.1 kg and costs 5 credits.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Weapon Type:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Exotic Weapons (Ranged)"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Exotic_Weapons_(Ranged)","referenceId":"reference:c954289d43de9110"},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Size:"]}," Large\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Cost:"]}," 250\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Damage:"]}," 3d4 (Ranged), 1d8 (Melee)\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Stun"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Stun"}," Setting:"]}," NO\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Rate of Fire:"]}," Single-Shot\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Weight:"]}," 9.8 Kilograms\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Type:"]}," Bludgeoning\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Availability:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Rare"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Rare"},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Inaccurate:"]}," This weapon cannot fire at targets at Long ",{"tag":"a","children":["Range"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Range"},".\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
